// title: Graphite
// order: 40
// Graphite — a sleek modern dark mini-player: a soft matte charcoal body
// with gentle rounded extrusions, recessed near-black display windows with
// thin light-grey type, a minimal spectrum of hairline white bars, dark
// softly shaded keys grouped in a pill cluster, and a single orange accent.
//
// Assignments only, over the base templates in `src/hw.rs`
// (see local/agent_state/skeuomorph/music/STYLE_GUIDE.md).
